{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"e54313c08f8bca1500fbf879622553e3bc3c764f1011e7568aefe1034143b925"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:b42ccf781f5dc6c5fb42880e3bb8f687758854683df19aa4fd5a9f3593962e92","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"no","evidence":"[D18:7 | 10:56 am on 13 September, 2023] Calvin: Thanks Dave! Lots of cool stuff happening. Next up, a tour - so excited! After that, I'm off to explore and grow my brand. Can't wait to see what the future has in store!\n[D16:2 | 2:55 pm on 31 August, 2023] Calvin: Hey Dave! The tour was amazing! I was so pumped from all the energy from the audience. This pic totally captures how I felt. Such an amazing time!\n[D7:1 | 6:06 pm on 31 May, 2023] Calvin: Hey Dave! Been ages since we chatted. So much has gone down. Touring with Frank Ocean last week was wild. Tokyo was unreal -- the crowd was insane. I felt so alive when performing, can't find the words to express it.","itemId":"urn:uuid:5d1127b7-1e47-58d0-98bf-3cc9ef2c954a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:6a386442ed2eb4d33946861708e54979f9c83587252239e04b68402a82fa31cb","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Does Calvin love music tours?","referenceAnswer":"yes","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"6a386442ed2eb4d33946861708e54979f9c83587252239e04b68402a82fa31cb"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}